{
  "uid": "aiquaa-postgres",
  "title": "aiquaa - Postgres bajo carga",
  "description": "Estado de la base durante una prueba de rendimiento. Dos fuentes: Prometheus (postgres_exporter y el endpoint de Supabase, via Alloy) para las series historicas, y el datasource Postgres directo para pg_stat_statements y pg_stat_activity, que son puntuales y no tienen historia propia.",
  "tags": [
    "aiquaa",
    "postgres",
    "rendimiento"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30m",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "editable": true,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "label": "Prometheus",
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "DS_POSTGRES",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "label": "Postgres (qa_monitor)",
        "current": {}
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Conexiones usadas / 60",
      "description": "EL techo real de este sistema. max_connections = 60 y es un recurso GLOBAL, compartido con datos de produccion ajenos que viven fuera de qa_training. Si esto se acerca a 60, la prueba deja de medir la aplicacion y pasa a medir el agotamiento del pool.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 35
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 50
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "max": 60,
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(pg_stat_activity_count)",
          "legendFormat": "conexiones",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Cache hit ratio",
      "description": "blks_hit / (blks_hit + blks_read). Por debajo de ~0.99 en una carga repetitiva significa que el working set no entra en shared_buffers (224 MB en esta instancia).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 6,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.95
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 0.99
              }
            ]
          },
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit[5m])) / (sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_hit[5m])) + sum(rate(pg_stat_database_blks_read[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "hit ratio",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Entradas en pg_stat_statements",
      "description": "EL PANEL DEL HARD PARSE. Con SQL parametrizado se mantiene plano: un statement, un plan reutilizable. Con /api/perf/db?mode=literal cada request concatena un valor distinto y crea una entrada NUEVA, asi que este numero se dispara en vivo. Es la forma de mostrar la destruccion de la cache de planes sin track_planning, que en esta instancia esta en off.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_POSTGRES}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_POSTGRES}"
          },
          "format": "time_series",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT now() AS time, count(*) AS statements FROM extensions.pg_stat_statements",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Transacciones/s",
      "description": "xact_commit + xact_rollback. El numero que el QA deberia relevar ANTES de disenar la prueba: cual es el maximo sostenido conocido de este sistema.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 6,
        "x": 18,
        "y": 0
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "graphMode": "area",
        "colorMode": "value"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(rate(pg_stat_database_xact_commit[1m])) + sum(rate(pg_stat_database_xact_rollback[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "tps",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Conexiones por estado",
      "description": "active vs idle vs idle in transaction. 'idle in transaction' creciendo es una fuga de transacciones abiertas: se queda con una conexion de las 60 sin hacer trabajo.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "sum by (state) (pg_stat_activity_count)",
          "legendFormat": "{{state}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "CPU y memoria de la instancia de Postgres",
      "description": "Viene del endpoint Prometheus de Supabase, scrapeado por Alloy. Si ese endpoint no esta disponible en este plan, el panel queda vacio y el resto del dashboard sigue funcionando (ver perf/README.md).",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "rate(node_cpu_seconds_total{mode!=\"idle\"}[1m])",
          "legendFormat": "cpu {{mode}}",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${DS_PROMETHEUS}"
          },
          "expr": "node_memory_MemAvailable_bytes",
          "legendFormat": "memoria disponible",
          "editorMode": "code",
          "range": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Top 20 queries por tiempo total de ejecucion",
      "description": "De extensions.pg_stat_statements. mean_ms alto con calls bajo = query lenta. mean_ms bajo con calls altisimo = el problema es el volumen, no la query. Sin pg_monitor, el texto de las queries de otros roles aparece redactado.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_POSTGRES}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 13
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_POSTGRES}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT\n  calls,\n  round(total_exec_time::numeric, 1) AS total_ms,\n  round(mean_exec_time::numeric, 2)  AS mean_ms,\n  rows,\n  left(query, 200)                   AS query\nFROM extensions.pg_stat_statements\nORDER BY total_exec_time DESC\nLIMIT 20",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Tuplas muertas y ultimo autovacuum",
      "description": "n_dead_tup creciendo sin autovacuum reciente es bloat. Despues de una corrida con escrituras, perf_carga deberia aparecer aca arriba.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_POSTGRES}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_POSTGRES}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT\n  schemaname || '.' || relname AS tabla,\n  n_live_tup                   AS vivas,\n  n_dead_tup                   AS muertas,\n  last_autovacuum,\n  last_autoanalyze\nFROM pg_stat_user_tables\nWHERE schemaname IN ('qa_training', 'qa_training_v2', 'public')\nORDER BY n_dead_tup DESC\nLIMIT 15",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Esperas ahora mismo",
      "description": "pg_stat_activity agrupado por wait_event_type. Bajo carga, 'Lock' o 'LWLock' dominando significa contencion, no falta de CPU.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
        "uid": "${DS_POSTGRES}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 22
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "footer": {
          "show": false
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "grafana-postgresql-datasource",
            "uid": "${DS_POSTGRES}"
          },
          "format": "table",
          "rawQuery": true,
          "rawSql": "SELECT\n  coalesce(wait_event_type, 'sin espera') AS tipo_espera,\n  coalesce(wait_event, '-')               AS evento,\n  count(*)                                AS backends\nFROM pg_stat_activity\nWHERE backend_type = 'client backend'\nGROUP BY 1, 2\nORDER BY 3 DESC",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
